' ==============================================================================
' 3-1-unideal-prijava-UC.puml
'
' Svrha:    Prijava i profil: kako se student, partner i administrator prijavljuju i uređuju profil (UC-1.1 – UC-1.4).
' Autor:    Elide Babić
' AI:       Nacrt je izrađen uz pomoć alata Claude prema uputama autorice;
'           autorica ga je iscrtala, provjerila prema specifikacijama u 3.2 i
'           odgovara za sadržaj.
'
' Diagram level: System Requirements
' Diagram type:  Use Case Diagram
' ==============================================================================

@startuml
' Smjer veza (predavanja, slajd 24): aktivni akter -> obrazac, obrazac -> pasivni akter.
title UniDeal – prijava i profil (Slika 3.2)
left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #212529

skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
    BorderColor #212529
    BackgroundColor<<external system>> #FFF3CD
    BorderColor<<external system>> #856404
}

skinparam usecase {
    BackgroundColor #E7F1FF
    BorderColor #0D6EFD
}

actor "Student" as Student
actor "Partner" as Partner
actor "Administrator" as Admin

actor "Pružatelji identiteta\n(Microsoft, Google)" as IdP <<external system>>
actor "Resend\n(e-mail)" as Mail <<external system>>

rectangle "Sustav UniDeal" {
    (UC-1.1\nPrijava studenta\nMicrosoft računom) as UC11
    (UC-1.2\nPrijava partnera Google\nračunom ili e-mailom) as UC12
    (UC-1.3\nPrihvaćanje uvjeta\nkorištenja) as UC13
    (UC-1.4\nUređivanje profila i\ndeaktivacija računa) as UC14
}

Student --> UC11
Student --> UC14
Partner --> UC12
Partner --> UC14
Admin --> UC14

' Uvjeti korištenja prikazuju se samo pri prvoj prijavi.
UC11 <.. UC13 : <<extend>>\n[prva prijava]
UC12 <.. UC13 : <<extend>>\n[prva prijava]

UC11 --> IdP
UC12 --> IdP
UC12 --> Mail
@enduml
